abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline (single-script) for the methodological study
  evaluating coverage, representativeness, and selection bias in Brazil's
  telephone-based health surveillance system (Vigitel) compared to the
  National Health Survey (PNS), using the Fairlie 2005 decomposition,
  response propensity modelling, and ADEMP simulation framework.
